      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Client SDK\nRuns Inside application services\n\n* Generate traceId & spandId\n* propogate trace context  via headers\n* Create spans\n* send spans asysnchronously to collectors",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Client SDK\nRuns Inside application services\n\n* Generate traceId & spandId\n* propogate trace context  via headers\n* Create spans\n* send spans asysnchronously to collectors",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
