      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786992584906,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Sampling Service\n* Manage sampling rules\n* Distribute sampling configs to collectors\n* Prioritize error / slow traces",
