      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786992848337,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Queue\n* Decouple write spikes\n* Enable replay & reprocessing\n* Guarantee ordering per trace (partition by traceId)\n\n\n5. Aggregator\n* Group spans by traceId\n* Build parent-child relationships\n* compute trace metadata\n* detect incomplete traces\n\n\n6. Database Service\nAbstraction over DB\n* persist traces & spans\n* write to multiple denormalized tables\n* Enforce retention policies\n* Handle compaction & TTL (7/30 days)\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Queue\n* Decouple write spikes\n* Enable replay & reprocessing\n* Guarantee ordering per trace (partition by traceId)\n\n\n5. Aggregator\n* Group spans by traceId\n* Build parent-child relationships\n* compute trace metadata\n* detect incomplete traces\n\n\n6. Database Service\nAbstraction over DB\n* persist traces & spans\n* write to multiple denormalized tables\n* Enforce retention policies\n* Handle compaction & TTL (7/30 days)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
