      "text": "7. Query Service\n\n* Serve trace lookup APIs\n* Execute indexed searches\n* Aggregate span data for UI\n\n\n8. Dependency Analyzer Service\n* Build service depedency graph\n* compute latency percentiles\n* detect abnormal call patterns",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7. Query Service\n\n* Serve trace lookup APIs\n* Execute indexed searches\n* Aggregate span data for UI\n\n\n8. Dependency Analyzer Service\n* Build service depedency graph\n* compute latency percentiles\n* detect abnormal call patterns",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
